      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 24 2020 03:34:22 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>The SPY Portable Handheld Imager (SPY-PHI) utilizes SPY Fluorescence Imaging Technology, and allows surgeons to visualize blood flow in vessels and related tissue perfusion during plastic, microsurgical, reconstructive and gastrointestinal procedures. SPY-PHI's modalties include: white light, SPY Fluorescence Mode, Overlay Fluorescence Mode and Color-Segmented Fluorescence Mode.</p>\n<p>Now approved for use in cervical and uterine lymphatic mapping as well as pediatric surgery!**</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Sep 04 2020 16:26:58 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
