      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 24 2020 03:36:23 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Connected OR Hub</span></span></span></p>\n<p>The Connected OR Hub provides total control of the entire visualization system from the surgical field. The new intuitive interface and improved work flow matches real-world application, making control faster and easier than ever before.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>User profiles: Surgeon Profiles allow customized settings to auto-populate before you even enter the OR, creating a consistent surgical environment.</li>\n<li>Device and voice control: Allows surgeons to annotate on the fly from the 1688 camera head, wireless headset or wireless remote control.</li>\n<li>iPad App: Use Stryker’s My Patient Hub iPad application to share custom post-operative reports and images with patients.</li>\n<li>Dual channel: Record two video signals independently or simultaneously.</li>\n<li>Media Asset Management: Securely edit, archive, and share your surgical images and videos.</li>\n<li>MPEG4 (H.264) encoding: Enables high-quality 1080p video to be stored using minimal space.</li>\n<li>1TB hard drive: Store up to 500 cases in the internal archive.</li>\n<li>On-screen device status: Provides the surgeon a convenient way to view real-time device status such as insufflator pressure on the surgical display.</li>\n<li>Customizable surgical timeout checklist: Easily and efficiently conduct full stop at timeout, print a hard copy and store a digital copy to the case file.</li>\n<li>Wireless network connectivity: Wirelessly integrate with hospital networks, such as PACS.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Aug 21 2020 16:43:15 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
